<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13905"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, August 06, 2005 - 1:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Anyone with a message for Dennis Rader may post here.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13905-->
<!--Post: 13925--><!--Time: 1123862570-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13925"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, August 12, 2005 - 9:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Bondage THIS you dysfunctioanl joke of a human being.  You are so all about your pitiful self.  YOUR victims are now beautiful angels...you DID NOT take their souls away - YOUR SOUL now belongs to the devil - keep right on giving your desired interviews to the media..keep right on thinking that any of us care about your feelings...every single time you open your sewer mouth you put your infested foot in.  You want fame..your fame is in hell - your hell will begin here on earth in prison and continue in eternity.  SO BONDAGE THAT you scum<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13925-->
<!--Post: 13931--><!--Time: 1123907226-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13931"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, August 12, 2005 - 9:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->As you sit in that Court room struggling to face the people that you brought such a tremendous, unmeasureable amount of grief to, I want you to understand that there is one thing you can never take from them; that is the fond memories of their loved ones. You&#39;ll never share those memories with them and you&#39;ll never take them from the victims families. So, when your lying in your cold dark cell and thinking of your family, I want you to think about the memories you&#39;ll never be able to creat with Paula, Kristine and Jr. Just like you said &#34;your done&#34;. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13931-->
<!--Post: 13955--><!--Time: 1124167355-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13955"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, August 15, 2005 - 9:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Your family loved someone who never existed.  <BR>Your son has been counseled by Navy chaplins and in his mind must wonder if he has inherited any of his father&#39;s abnormailites which he may fear be latent. In five months he learned that his father was a serial killer, his parents got divorced, his boyhood home was sold and his naval base is on the list of targeted base closures. <BR>Your daughter with her sleep disorders likely had some phychological problems to begin with and then to learn her father is a serial killer and the ultimate divorce of her parents and sale of her childhood home in a matter of months must be a terrible toll for her to bear. Her marriage will probably be the next BTK victim. <BR>Would any of your children ever want children of their own knowing that as they were children you were a killer of children? <BR>Your wife saw her whole life collapse. She&#39;s lost her husband and home and job. She&#39;s viewed with a mix of sympathy and suspesicion. She generally has the publics sympathy but some view her as either an accomplice or an idiot for living with a 30 year serial killer and suspecting nothing. <BR>These people can&#39;t go back to Wichita. Their roots have been ripped out.  <BR>Your mother&#39;s health must have suffered and her lifespan is now much shorter. <BR>Your brothers and their families share the embarressment of being related to you and that problem will probably lead to more broken marriages and a lifelong burden. <BR>None of these people will ever get over this for as long as they live and their pain won&#39;t began to deminish while you are still alive. <BR>Your fellow congregation of your church has been shook to it&#39;s very core. They are betrayed and bewildered. <BR>Wichita has been sickend by you. Park City has been sickend by you. Kansas has been sickend by you. The nation has been sickend by you through the book about your crimes, news reports and then made further sicker by your pathetic callous courtroom confession. Most of the country had never heard of BTK and when they finally did it was not of a shadow to fear but of an unmasked pathetic excuse for a human being whom they instantly reviled. For Wichita fear and revulsion. For the USA just revulsion. <BR>For the relatives of your slaughter spree they can at least know that the killer of their loved ones is captured and locked away forever. <BR>For them I hope they don&#39;t parade you out of your cell for years of interviews with you about your sick mind on every crime show on TV that comes along. <BR>For them I hope there will be no made-for-TV movie. <BR>As for you, you likely will not be killed by a fellow inmate and istead will probably get fat on prison food. You&#39;ll probably be given the opportunity to lead a prison bible study group and go on to minister to other prisoners. Your facade that has enabled you to pass for a human being will remain intact and you&#39;ll most likely make several friends in your incarceration. Some prison official will one day refer to you as a &#34;model prisoner&#34; and you will be granted prison privilages and have a TV and books and magazines and a radio and be given library privilages and will find work in the prison kitchen or machine shop or maybe landscaping duties in the prison yard. And as you sort through your hate mail there will be plenty of letters from people who want to be your pen pal and misguided women who will want to get married to you. <BR>As you continue to age you&#39;ll spend more time in the prison infirmary than in your own cell and the state of Kansas will pay for your hospital care and medication and dental and surgical to prolong your life. <BR>And when you finally die they will burry you in a prison cemetery with a ground marker that will neither say Dennis Rader or BTK but simply your assigned prison number. And every once in a while a stray dog will pause for a moment there, lift a hind leg and piss on it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
